Z||000011||mrfixit58||09-13-2000||07:45 AM||||SNAKES ALIVE Eric,<P>Is that the 400 SBC? It looks SCARY fast. I would love to see the Dyno numbers on your setup. Your lid really deserves something different. How do you plan to blow paint into that area under the scoop?<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||4
Z||000012||Eric Marsh||09-13-2000||09:07 AM||||Hi Roy,<P>Yep, is a .030 over 400. I've got some photos of my build up on my web page, <A HREF="http://www.hotrodder.com/emarsh." TARGET=_blank>http://www.hotrodder.com/emarsh.</A>  I'm shooting for something in the 450 hp arena through the mufflers. As for how fast, the tranny has been slipping so I don't really know. It does like to act like a Fuel Altered when the tires get loose - kinda fun.As for painting the scoop, I've been looking at that and wondering the same thing.<P>Eric<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrfixit58:<BR><B>SNAKES ALIVE Eric,<P>Is that the 400 SBC? It looks SCARY fast. I would love to see the Dyno numbers on your setup. Your lid really deserves something different. How do you plan to blow paint into that area under the scoop?<P>Roy   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
