Z||000016||spike||09-14-2000||09:22 AM||||Only about 100.00 us. I paid 8.00 us for 2. If you are not in a hurry shop around or visit your local bone yard. Scoops don't seem all that easy to find, but if you could save 75.00 wouldn't it be worth a try. I have seen some on ebay as well. I have seen a few diff. scoops on Fiero's and they all look great to me.<P>Tks. Mike.||||reg||1
